      },
      "text": "Tuesday – Los Roques Archipelago"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4429d95c2f3710d012ef06f73251356484d334f5c132bf1636d54f608d9164a0",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw8xljay-hrdwq6",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Early transfer to the airport and flight to Los Roques. Hotel representatives will meet you on arrival.\n\nSpend the day relaxing on Madrisquí or Francisquí. A sun lounger and a packed lunch with drinks are provided.\n\nLos Roques is a Venezuelan archipelago and national park covering 2,250 square kilometres and encompassing more than 350 small Caribbean islands. One of the country’s most important marine reserves, it has clear water, green islands and white beaches.\n\n**Meals:** packed lunch and dinner."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_label:861d071ba99fde81",
      "field": "itinerary.label",
      "sourceTextSha256": "6bccbb3b85f58f99ea8573c174dc63b9dc034a396ee255e7f05bb29b5989fbaa",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw8xljay-hrdwq6",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Los Roques"
    },
