        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw8xljay-hrdwq6",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Wednesday – Los Roques and return to Caracas"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:4b5ff9b4a37f43cc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "063690c87273628f89ba5098bb00352479682fee3a7fa90bd6f404a5657ac45b",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw8xljay-hrdwq6",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Continue your stay on Madrisquí or Francisquí. A sun lounger and a packed lunch with drinks are included.\n\nFly to Caracas in the afternoon. Meet your transfer, then check in at a hotel near the airport and rest.\n\n**Meals:** breakfast and packed lunch.\n\nOptional activities include a trip to the outlying islands, including Cayo de Agua, a visit to a sea turtle conservation station, a visit to a natural pool with starfish and fishing for barracuda from a boat."
    },
